<title>UK: CRICKET-ATHERTON REAPPOINTED AS ENGLAND CAPTAIN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ATHERTON REAPPOINTED AS ENGLAND CAPTAIN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mike Atherton was reappointed on Thursday as England captain for the tours of Zimbabwe and New Zealand.</p>
<p>Atherton, 28, has led England 35 times since taking over from Graham Gooch three years ago but won only two series.</p>
<p>This year he guided England to a 1-0 series win over India before losing 2-0 to Pakistan in the second three-test series of the English summmer.</p>
</text>
